  <div class="lab-scenario">
    This lab targets <strong>CWE-362: Concurrent Execution Using Shared Resource with Improper Synchronization</strong> (Race Condition / TOCTOU). The application checks the balance (Time of Check) and deducts it (Time of Use) as separate, non-atomic operations. When multiple requests arrive simultaneously, they all pass the balance check before any deduction is written — allowing the same balance to be spent multiple times.
